# Mode7Controller, ControlMissionStarted (listing 4975-4983; FT 0x429d7f): with the mode timer running, the countdown text
# 3035 (seconds left = time left / 1000) is shown for 0.5 s; with the timer idle (time left 0) nothing is shown.
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
50 poke info_text_box message_field 7
100 event info_text_box ControlMissionStarted
100 expect none text info_text_box display id 3035
120 msg mode_timer TTimerResetTimer 30.65
130 event info_text_box ControlMissionStarted
130 expect text info_text_box display id 3035
200 quit
